### Weather (Open-Meteo) — no key needed
GET https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=18.090829&longitude=79.465273&current=temperature_2m,relative_humidity_2m,wind_speed_10m,cloud_cover,surface_pressure,precipitation,shortwave_radiation,soil_temperature_0cm,soil_moisture_0_to_1cm

###

### Soil (ISRIC SoilGrids v2.0) — current source, no key. Returns sand/silt/clay %, pH, SOC per depth.
GET https://rest.isric.org/soilgrids/v2.0/properties/query?lon=79.465273&lat=18.090829&property=sand&property=clay&property=silt&property=phh2o&property=soc&depth=0-5cm

###

### Soil (OpenLandMap) — DEPRECATED: their /query/point API dropped the USDA great-group layer entirely.
### Every coll/regex combo now returns {"error":"The corresponding files could not be found..."}.
GET https://api.openlandmap.org/query/point?lat=18.090829&lon=79.465273&coll=predicted250m&regex=grtgroup

###

### Satellite fallback #1: PhytoLens remote-sensing backend (key optional; the live service currently needs none)
POST https://remotesensing-backend-952153121532.us-central1.run.app/analyze-all
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geojson": {
    "type": "Feature",
    "geometry": {
      "type": "Polygon",
      "coordinates": [[
        [79.465273, 18.090829],
        [79.465868, 18.090835],
        [79.465782, 18.090121],
        [79.465273, 18.090829]
      ]]
    },
    "properties": {}
  },
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-07-25"
}

###

### Satellite fallback #2 (open data, no key): NASA MODIS MOD13Q1 NDVI via ORNL DAAC.
### DOY dates (A2021001); kmAboveBelow/kmLeftRight=0 → single pixel at the point.
GET https://modis.ornl.gov/rst/api/v1/MOD13Q1/subset?latitude=18.090829&longitude=79.465273&startDate=A2026201&endDate=A2026228&band=250m_16_days_NDVI&kmAboveBelow=0&kmLeftRight=0

###

### Remote-sensing backend's own live API spec — source of truth if routes change again
GET https://remotesensing-backend-952153121532.us-central1.run.app/openapi.json
